**What shipped:** Revenue Forecast on /admin/analytics — a new "Forecast & Show Rate" section with a card showing expected revenue from **upcoming** bookings for **today / tomorrow / this week / this month** (studio-local VN/UTC+7 windows, anchored on now; each window counts only what is still to come). Each tile shows the VND forecast plus "X to charge · Y on credit".

**Credit-covered = 0 rule:** a booking a client will pay for with a package credit **for that class type** contributes **0** forecast revenue (already paid). "Will pay with credit" = the booking is flagged \`PACKAGE_CREDIT\` / carries a \`PackageInstanceId\`, OR the client still holds active, unexpired package credits covering that session's format bucket (GROUP/MAT → GROUP credits, PRIVATE/DUO → PRIVATE credits). Balances are consumed chronologically, so a client with N credits and >N upcoming bookings only zeroes N of them; uncovered seats are charged at the session drop-in price (its snapshot, else the live blueprint price). Blocks/freelance/cancelled/late-cancel/no-show/reschedule excluded.

**Files:** \`SoulPilates.Services/AnalyticsService.cs\` (GetRevenueForecastAsync), \`SoulPilates.Core/Interfaces/IAnalyticsService.cs\`, \`SoulPilates.Core/DTOs/ForecastShowRateDto.cs\` (RevenueForecastDto), \`SoulPilates.API/Controllers/AnalyticsController.cs\` (GET /api/analytics/revenue-forecast), \`SoulPilates.Astro/src/pages/admin/analytics.astro\`.

**Branch:** \`${branch}\` @ \`${tip.slice(0, 10)}\` (pushed, remote==local verified).
**Build:** production graph (Core+Infra+Services+API) \`dotnet build\` = 0 errors; Astro build = 0 errors (59 pages). Read-only, no Mongo writes.
**Deploy note:** NOT deployed — prod/staging containers untouched, nothing restarted, no docker build. Deploy is handed back to you (rebuild soulpilates-prod backend + frontend from this branch when ready).`;

const showrateComment = `**Claude — built + pushed (isolated worktree, prod untouched).**

**What shipped:** Show Rate on /admin/analytics — a card in the new "Forecast & Show Rate" section with two percentages: **show rate for NEW clients** and **show rate for RECURRING clients**, each with the "attended / booked" counts behind it. Reacts to the month picker like the other cards.

**Definitions:** show rate = **attended ÷ booked** over the selected period. *Booked* = finalized attendances whose class actually ran in the window (\`CHECKED_IN\`/\`ARRIVED\`/\`NO_SHOW\`); still-future, cancelled, late-cancel and rescheduled rows are excluded (they never reached a show/no-show verdict). *Attended* = \`CHECKED_IN\`/\`ARRIVED\`. **NEW** = the client had **no prior attended class** before that session's start (first-ever visit); **RECURRING** = they had ≥1 prior attended class. Classified per-attendance from the client's history at class time (not a whole-period cohort), so a first-timer who no-shows still counts against the NEW denominator. Anonymous rows (no ClientId) excluded.

**Files:** \`SoulPilates.Services/AnalyticsService.cs\` (GetShowRateAsync), \`SoulPilates.Core/Interfaces/IAnalyticsService.cs\`, \`SoulPilates.Core/DTOs/ForecastShowRateDto.cs\` (ShowRateDto/ShowRateCohortDto), \`SoulPilates.API/Controllers/AnalyticsController.cs\` (GET /api/analytics/show-rate), \`SoulPilates.Astro/src/pages/admin/analytics.astro\`.

